      en: ["Largest Inca fortress in the Pambamarca complex", "Situated at a strategic altitude of 3,788 meters", "Consists of more than 100 identified stone structures", "Features 3 concentric defensive walls", "Built during the reign of Huayna Capac (ca. 1490-1500)", "Site of numerous stone sling bullets found from past conflicts"],
