      en: ["Inaugurated in the year 1921", "Sculptor: Miguel Blay from Spain", "Materials: bronze and white marble", "Monument height: approx. 12 meters", "Location: Av. Pedro Menéndez Gilbert", "Theme: Legend of Guayas and Quil"],
